  "en": {
    "id": 8015050,
    "name": "Lord of Saṃvartasthāyi, Asat Pramad: \"Decay\"",
    "desc": "The Lord Ravager known as Asat Pramad is devising a game to destroy the Elation.\\nHe invades defenseless planets, forges from golden blood a lineage born only to destroy, all to mock life itself, and with it, mock the Elation.\\nYet, this is far from enough to satisfy him. To realize his grand ambition of eliminating the Elation, he resolves to awaken the Aeon to carry out the most thorough destruction, even if the cost might be himself.\\nUltimately, as the Express arrives once more, the time is ripe. He enters the game under a stolen identity, striving to craft the most magnificent and absolute finale to this game.",
